{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_01AF20","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"要炸毁村子北面的路障，需要<R=　C　4　,Composition 4>炸药。Snake，你应该很熟悉怎么用了吧？","cn_control_tokens":"<R=　C　4　,Composition 4>","cn_utf8_bytes":121,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。从C3时代起就没少用。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"C3啊。记得是因为在寒冷地区会变脆，所以后来才换成C4的吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_SPLIT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"可以随意塑形的塑胶炸药。稳定性很高，没有起爆装置就不会爆炸。就算点火，也只会普通地燃烧……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":"AUX_CROSS_ROW_SPLIT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"听说在越南，还有美军士兵拿它当燃料用。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"AUX_QUANTIFIER_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"把它安放在路障附近后，先移动到安全地点，再按起爆按钮引爆。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"AUX_TRUNCATED_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""}]}